at","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2023-11-30T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"While the family copes with a devastating loss, a violent riot helps bring Dev and Sandhya back together. Kairav is desprate as Rajbir and Bhenno go rogue. Dev is accused of murder and has to prove his innocence.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zcxbeZUDn2bs6Eb1U1vu0ShWMK8.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMy9TaGVoYXItTGFraG90LSUyOFRWLVNlcmllcy0yMDIzLSUyOS8.1.4","title":"One last surprise, Mr. Tomar?","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2023-11-30T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Dev grapples with the charges against him while dealing with his father’s illness. Rajbir finds out about Kairav’s illegal business and gets ready to tighten the noose. Dev discovers Sandhya’s secret and is devastated.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hwM0Cwo3bOj8pBP911SW4zel4fV.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMy9TaGVoYXItTGFraG90LSUyOFRWLVNlcmllcy0yMDIzLSUyOS8.1.5","title":"Careful, anything can happen","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2023-11-30T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Dev tries to make amends with his father. Rajbir and Bhenno try to side-line Kairav. Vikas faces pressure from Kairav to call off the protest. Dev and Vidushi discover Jay was involved in illegal activities for Kairav.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jCGoiBwITrvI5AZNiLeBvNoEubi.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMy9TaGVoYXItTGFraG90LSUyOFRWLVNlcmllcy0yMDIzLSUyOS8.1.6","title":"It's all beyond me","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2023-11-30T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Dev has a surprise visitor who won’t take no for an answer. Dev and Antariksh discover shocking evidence from Kairav’s hotel. Bhi and Bho chase a ghost which leads to devastating consequences for both.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cG4BCMDHgPBVMiLmU86ddESvyaz.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEu